      "body": "项目名称：LiteAI-SDK\n项目地址：https://github.com/BHznJNs/liteai\n\n# 项目描述\n\nLiteAI-SDK 是一个封装了 [LiteLLM](https://github.com/BerriAI/litellm)，旨在提供更直观的 API 和更方便的工具接入的 Python 库。得益于 LiteLLM 对于各种 LLM 供应商的适配，LiteAI-SDK 能让你用更简单的代码接入各种主流 LLM 提供商。\n\n## 核心功能\n\nPython 函数直接作为工具接入：\n\n```python\nimport os\nfrom liteai_sdk import LLM, LlmProviders, LlmRequestParams, UserMessage\n\ndef example_tool():\n    \"\"\"\n    This is a test tool that is used to test the tool calling functionality.\n    \"\"\"\n    print(\"The example tool is called.\")\n    return \"Hello World\"\n\nllm = LLM(provider=LlmProviders.OPENAI,\n          api_key=os.getenv(\"API_KEY\", \"\"),\n          base_url=os.getenv(\"BASE_URL\", \"\"))\n\nparams = LlmRequestParams(\n        model=\"deepseek-v3.1\",\n        tools=[example_tool],\n        messages=[UserMessage(\"...\")])\n```\n\n在识别到模型返回工具调用指令时自动进行工具调用（由 execute_tools 参数控制）：\n```python\ndef example_tool():\n    \"\"\"\n    This is a test tool that is used to test the tool calling functionality.\n    \"\"\"\n    print(\"The example tool is called.\")\n    return \"Hello World\"\n\nllm = LLM(provider=LlmProviders.OPENAI,\n          api_key=os.getenv(\"API_KEY\", \"\"),\n          base_url=os.getenv(\"BASE_URL\", \"\"))\n\nparams = LlmRequestParams(\n        model=\"deepseek-v3.1\",\n        tools=[example_tool],\n        execute_tools=True,\n        messages=[UserMessage(\"Please call the tool example_tool.\")])\n\nprint(\"User: \", \"Please call the tool example_tool.\")\nmessages = llm.generate_text_sync(params)\nfor message in messages:\n    match message.role:\n        case \"assistant\":\n            print(\"Assistant: \", message.content)\n        case \"tool\":\n            print(\"Tool: \", message.content)\n\n\"\"\" outputs:\nUser:  Please call the tool example_tool.\nThe example tool is called.\nAssistant:  I'll call the example_tool for you.\nTool:  \"Hello World\"\n\"\"\"\n```",
